{
  "id": "122",
  "title": "Little Ming's Quarrel",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-05-21",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming and his desk mate in school are having a falling out when his friend suddenly receives a text message. Is it Little Ming trying to reconcile?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/135/fb81c20a21106a18e67de7f8a004c179202fa34e.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "吵架\n\n小明今天和同桌吵架了，上课时谁也不理谁。\n突然，同桌收到了小明发来的短信，上面写着：对不起。\n同桌非常感动，拿起手机，正想回信息给小明，只见小明指着同桌大喊：“老师，他上课玩手机！”",
    "traditional": "吵架\n\n小明今天和同桌吵架了，上課時誰也不理誰。\n突然，同桌收到了小明發來的短信，上面寫著：對不起。\n同桌非常感動，拿起手機，正想回信息給小明，只見小明指著同桌大喊：“老師，他上課玩手機！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Quarreling"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明今天和同桌吵架了，上课时谁也不理谁。",
      "traditional": "小明今天和同桌吵架了，上課時誰也不理誰。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng jīn tiān hé tóng zhuō chǎo jià le shàng kè shí shéi yě bù lǐ shéi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today Little Ming and his desk mate had a falling out, and were ignoring each other in class."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "突然，同桌收到了小明发来的短信，上面写着：对不起。",
      "traditional": "突然，同桌收到了小明發來的短信，上面寫著：對不起。",
      "pinyin": "tū rán tóng zhuō shōu dào le xiǎo míng fā lái de duǎn xìn shàng miàn xiě zhe duì bu qǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Suddenly, the desk mate received a message from Little Ming, saying: “I'm sorry”."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "同桌非常感动，拿起手机，",
      "traditional": "同桌非常感動，拿起手機，",
      "pinyin": "tóng zhuō fēi cháng gǎn dòng ná qǐ shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "正想回信息给小明，只见小明指着同桌大喊：",
      "traditional": "正想回信息給小明，只見小明指著同桌大喊：",
      "pinyin": "zhèng xiǎng huí xìn xī gěi xiǎo míng zhǐ jiàn xiǎo míng zhǐ zhe tóng zhuō dà hǎn",
      "english": "The desk mate was very moved and picked up his cell phone."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“老师，他上课玩手机！”",
      "traditional": "“老師，他上課玩手機！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī tā shàng kè wán shǒu jī",
      "english": "Just when he was about to respond to Little Ming, he saw Little Ming pointing at him shouting:"
    }
  ],
